WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.025
Start with what Microsoft gives you.

2
00:00:02.025 --> 00:00:07.883
The audit trail names four activities:
disable account, enable account, delete user,

3
00:00:07.883 --> 00:00:11.789
and an update to the refresh
token valid-from timestamp,

4
00:00:11.789 --> 00:00:15.100
each with its time, result,
initiator and target.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.590
Each workflow run has its
own record, with its status,

6
00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:21.188
its times and its count of failed tasks.

7
00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:24.863
The schedule moves the timing:
every three hours by default,

8
00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:26.813
with a three-day catch-up window.

9
00:00:26.813 --> 00:00:30.960
And the disable task doesn't support
users who hold directory roles.
